        "node_id": 2826,
        "properties": {
          "content": "1\tBroadcast neighbor cell’s Qrxlevminoffsetcell and Qqualminoffsetcell in camping cell’s SIB3/4/5. The new IE should be optional.\n=>\tConfirm understanding that if the UE determines there is a need to re-select a candidate target cell, the UE performs a final suitability check before actually re-selecting to the candidate target cell.\n=>\tServing cell is not mandatory to broadcast the cell specific Qrxlevminoffsetcell and Qqualminoffsetcell even if different Qrxlevmin and Qqualmin are configured for the neighbor cells.\nCB on Friday: Provide 38.331 CR in R2-1812989 (ZTE) and 38.304 in R2-1812990 (vivo) CR according to the agreement. (Offline #288)\nR2-1812277\tCell suitability and cell reselection\tEricsson, NTT DOCOMO INC.\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811246\tPing-pong cell reselection issue\tCATT\tdiscussion\tRel-15\t38.304\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811247\tPing-pong cell reselection issue\tCATT\tCR\tRel-15\t38.304\t15.0.0\t0027\t-\tF\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1812431\tDiscussion on immediate cell reselection issue\tHuawei, HiSilicon\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1812517\tRemaining issues on immediate cell reselection\tSAMSUNG Electronics Co., Ltd.\tdiscussion\tNR_newRAT-Core\tWithdrawn\np-MAX:\nR2-1811517\tDiscussion on p-MAX for 5G NR Cell selection/reselection issue\tCMCC\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\n=>\tNoted\nR2-1812278\tMeasurement threshold with different power class Ues\tEricsson, NTT DOCOMO INC.\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\n=>\tNoted\n=>\tRAN2 did not reach any consensus on the solution to resolve the issue in Alt.1. It doesn’t mean there is no feasible solution.\nCB on Friday:=>\tDraft reply LS in R2-1812986 to indicate our agreement and ask RAN4 to take it into account. The final decision should be made in RAN4. From RAN2 perspective Alt.2 is feasible and no RAN2 impact. (Offline#222, CMCC)\nR2-1811516\tCR on introducing new IE for calculating Pcompensation in cell selection criterion S for 38.331\tCMCC\tdraftCR\tRel-15\t38.331\t15.2.0\tF\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811518\tReply LS on cell selection issue in idle mode for 5G NR HPUE\tCMCC\tLS out\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\tTo:RAN4\nR2-1812290\t[E555] Correction to absense of p-Max in SIB2 and SIB4\tEricsson\tdraftCR\tRel-15\t38.331\t15.2.1\tF\tNR_newRAT-Core\n=>\tAgreed to be added to SA CR.\nIdle redistribution\nR2-1811391\tInter-frequencycell Redistribution in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE\tChina Telecom, ZTE Corporation\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811607\tCR on introduction of load redistribution in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE in TS38.304\tChina Telecom, ZTE Corporation\tCR\tRel-15\t38.304\t15.0.0\t0037\t-\tB\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811608\tCR on introduction of load redistribution in RRC_IDLE and RRC_INACTIVE in TS38.331\tChina Telecom, ZTE Corporation\tCR\tRel-15\t38.331\t15.2.1\t0163\t-\tB\tNR_newRAT-Core\nSpeed dependent\nR2-1811277\tSpeed dependent cell reselection priority\tKDDI Corporation, Kyocera\tdiscussion\tR2-1809941\nR2-1811505\tMobility-state-based cell reselection in NR for HSDN\tCMCC, Apple\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811506\t38.304 CR to introduce mobility-state-based cell reselection for NR HSDN\tCMCC\tCR\tRel-15\t38.304\t15.0.0\t0035\t-\tB\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811507\t38.331 CR to introduce mobility-state-based cell reselection for NR HSDN\tCMCC\tdraftCR\tRel-15\t38.331\t15.2.0\tB\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811515\tCR on cell selection criterion S for 38.304\tCMCC\tCR\tRel-15\t38.304\t15.0.0\t0036\t-\tF\tNR_newRAT-Core\nOthers\nR2-1812432\tDiscussion on cell selection in case of state transition from CONNECTED to INACTIVE\tHuawei, HiSilicon\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1812904\tCR on cell selection in case of state transition from CONNECTED to INACTIVE\tHuawei, HiSilicon\tCR\tRel-15\t38.304\t15.0.0\t0045\t-\tF\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1812279\tHandling RAT priorities in low freq NR deployment scnearios\tEricsson\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core\nR2-1811404\tDiscussion on tendency of cell reselection to cells with more beams\tSpreadtrum Communications\tdiscussion\tRel-15\nR2-1812112\tClarification on q-RxLevMinSUL signaling in SIB1 (RIL T001, RIL T003)\tMTI\tdiscussion\tNR_newRAT-Core\tR2-1810525\nR2-1812114\tq-RxLevMinSUL in SIB1 (RIL T001, RIL T003)\tMTI\tdraftCR\tRel-15\t38.331\t15.2.1\tNR_newRAT-Core\tR2-1810554\nR2-1812433\tConsideration on cell reselection in multi-beam scenario\tHuawei, HiSilicon\tdiscussion\tRel-15\tNR_newRAT-Core",
